 * With <a href="/docs/connect">Connect</a>, you can create Stripe accounts for
 * your users. To do this, you’ll first need to <a
 * href="https://dashboard.stripe.com/account/applications/settings">register your
 * platform</a>.
 *
 * If you’ve already collected information for your connected accounts, you <a
 * href="/connect/marketplace/tasks/create#prefill-account-information">can prefill
 * that information</a> when creating the account. Connect Onboarding won’t ask for
 * the prefilled information during account onboarding. You can prefill any
